        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(codex): classify commandExecution mutability via shared isMutatingToolCall",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nFixes #101890 — strict-agentic retry cannot retry terminal turns that only\nperformed read-only inspection tools because `isMutatingNativeToolItem` always\ntreats `commandExecution` items as mutating.\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`isMutatingNativeToolItem` returns `true` for all `commandExecution` items,\nclassifying even read-only commands (grep, ls, rg, cat) as having side effects.\n\n## Fix\n\n1. Export `isMutatingToolCall` through the plugin SDK (`agent-harness-runtime`)\n   alongside the already-exported `isReplaySafeToolCall`\n2. Use `isMutatingToolCall(\"exec\", itemToolArgs(item))` in\n   `isMutatingNativeToolItem` instead of `return true`\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Runtime Proof\n\nThe regression test exercises the production `CodexAppServerEventProjector` —\nthe exact code path that classifies turns for strict-agentic retry:\n\n```\n✓ rg TODO src/agents     → replaySafe: true   (read-only)\n✓ grep -r foo .          → replaySafe: true   (read-only)\n✓ ls -la                 → replaySafe: true   (read-only)\n✓ cat package.json       → replaySafe: true   (read-only)\n✓ echo hello > /tmp/out  → replaySafe: false  (redirect)\n✓ rm -rf /tmp/cache      → replaySafe: false  (mutating)\n✓ npm install            → replaySafe: false  (mutating)\n```\n\nThe projector receives real `turn/completed` notifications with\n`commandExecution` items, runs the full `isMutatingNativeToolItem →\nisSideEffectingNativeToolItem → recordToolMeta → sideEffectingToolItemIds →\nhadPotentialSideEffects → replayMetadata` chain, and returns correct\nclassification.\n\n### Source-Level Proof\n\n```\nisMutatingToolCall(\"exec\", { command: \"rg TODO src\" })   → false\nisMutatingToolCall(\"exec\", { command: \"rm -rf /tmp\" })   → true\n```\n\n### Autoreview (claude-sonnet-5)\n\n```\n→ patch is correct (0.98), no accepted/actionable findings\n```\n\n- [x] `oxfmt --check` passes\n- [x] `oxlint` passes\n- [x] SDK test 9/9 passed\n- [x] Projector regression test 7/7 passed\n- [x] autoreview clean (claude-sonnet-5, 0.98)",
        "branch": "fix/101890-strict-agentic-retry-readonly",
